        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function takes a sample offset to provide maximum precision. If you need to jump to a given time, use the other overload.</para>
<para>The sample offset takes the channels into account. If you have a time offset instead, you can easily find the corresponding sample offset with the following formula: <computeroutput>timeInSeconds * sampleRate * channelCount</computeroutput> If the given offset exceeds to total number of samples, this function jumps to the end of the sound file.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sampleOffset</parametername>
